      "text": "Tesla shareholders: Our Annual Meeting is coming up on Dec 3rd\n\nThis year, we’re asking you to vote “FOR” all three proposals on the ballot, including the re-election of Elon Musk, Robyn Denholm and JB Straubel to Tesla’s Board.\n\nLast year, we laid out our vision for building a world of amazing abundance – this year, it’s been coming to life. And we’re only getting started…\n\nYour vote is critical to helping us maintain that momentum.\n\nVoting instructions & control numbers to follow soon.\n \nMore info: \nhttp://VoteTesla.com",
      "quote": null,
      "retweet": {
