        "text": "Early voting starts today in Texas.\n\nJames Talarico, in his own words:\n\nOn police: “It's always rich to me that defund the police is considered off limits...”\n\nOn guns: Assault weapons ban? “Absolutely.”\n\nOn ICE: “Tear down this secret police force.”\n\nOn prison: “Prison is violence.”\n\n“People don't belong in cages.”\n\nSend this to a Texas voter.",
